  "description": "Lightweight, fluent lifetime management for temporary scopes.\n\t\t\tDisposableHost provides reference-counted IDisposable tokens with event-driven\n\t\t\tBeginUsing, CountChanged, and FinalDispose notifications. Includes fluent\n\t\t\textensions such as WithOnDispose for declarative cleanup.",
